{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10337","headline":"酬陆少府 · 高适","name":"酬陆少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝临淇水岸，还望卫人邑。\n别意在山阿，征途背原隰。\n萧萧前村口，唯见转蓬入。\n水渚人去迟，霜天雁飞急。\n固应不远别，所与路未及。\n欲济川上舟，相思空伫立。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}